Cell["\<\
h[k] returns a Hermitian Hamiltonian. nOccupied is a positive integer \
selecting the lowest-energy eigenstates after sorting the eigensystem.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1187173383,ExpressionUUID->"ca94df56-f964-de48-ab05-e43c988586ca"],

Cell["\<\
The second argument has the format produced by \
PlaquetteRegionPartitionComplex. Each plaquette is an Extract position \
selecting its ordered vertex states; a triangle with indices i,j,k uses \
{{i,j,k}}.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->390526549,ExpressionUUID->"1794a026-5d62-524b-b85a-87341d1d7cb0"],

Cell["\<\
Each plaquette loop is closed internally. Its determinant phase is summed \
with the package convention -Total[phases]/(2 Pi). Plaquette orientation \
therefore affects the sign.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->261401944,ExpressionUUID->"3e8ee43c-e2c7-4f40-80ee-ae440ebbed5f"],

Cell["\<\
A meaningful Chern estimate requires a consistent oriented covering of the \
relevant closed momentum space and a separated occupied subspace. This \
function does not validate mesh orientation, convergence, or integrality.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->921747037,ExpressionUUID->"21ca367f-5df1-1a43-af27-2f13b6b78dfd"],

Cell["\<\
Eigensystem options are accepted and Method -> \"Direct\" is supplied \
internally.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->161952422,ExpressionUUID->"e1341c5c-e36c-ee4a-8f46-f55cc7f880bb"]
}, Closed]],

